  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A black jungle cat that lives in the ironpalm canopy; her mate was killed by Mistfall hunters and she has hunted them since. She drops out of the trees onto a random player (a long, loud warning), pulls a strangler vine taut across the ground (it roots you), and at 60% calls her grown cubs. At 30% she yowls in grief: a frightening cone and a get-in-close ring.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough — the drops are big. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; cubs 2 -> 3 at five; drops +1 per extra player.",
